[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-federal-government-yeidep-portal-registration-for-nigerians-50-000-500-000-grant--74":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},74,"federal-government-yeidep-portal-registration-for-nigerians-50-000-500-000-grant--74","Federal Government Yeidep Portal Registration For Nigerians (₦50,000 – ₦500,000 Grant)","\u003Cp>The Youth Economic Intervention and De-Radicalization Programme (YEIDEP) has been initiated to help youths access the business financing, enterprise development services, and other basic economic incentives and empowerment platforms.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Federal Government YEIDEP Grant Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Federal Government\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fgrants\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Grants\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦50,000 – ₦500,000 Grant\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training &amp; Empowerment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Job Creation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Click \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">\u003Cstrong>HERE\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa> To receive more daily scholarship updates from Scholars World\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Youth Economic Intervention and De-Radicalization Programme (YEIDEP) Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Federal Government YIEDEP Program is mainly aimed on;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Youth Economic Empowerment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>De-Radicalization and National Security\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Poverty Alleviation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Promotion of MSMEs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Beneficiaries of the YEIDEP grant get a sum of ₦50,000 – ₦500,000 \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Federal Government YIEDEP Portal Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the YEIDEP Grant, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a citizen of Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a youth between the ages of 18 and 35.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a valid National Identity Number (NIN) and Bank Verification Number (BVN).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Show interest or already be in any of the following businesses;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Agriculture\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fashion\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Technology (ICT)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Entertainment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Sports\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Renewable Energy\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Other productive businesses\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have an account with Lotus\u002FKeystone\u002FFidelity Bank\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be available to attend the training and mentorship program. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Register a Lotus\u002FKeyStone\u002FFidelity Bank Account for NIYEEDEP Program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To register with the Fidelity Bank for the NIYEEDEP Program (or any other bank), \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>you have to first complete your registration for the NIYEEDEP Program online.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>after you have obtained your membership code, you will proceed to the nearest Fidelity Bank branch with the code.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>this code will be used to create your personal bank account for the program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>To register with the Fidelity Bank for the NIYEEDEP Program, \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>you have to first complete your registration for the NIYEEDEP Program online.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>after you have obtained your membership code, you will proceed to the nearest Fidelity Bank branch with the code.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>this code will be used to create your personal bank account for the program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fyeidep.org\u002Fregister.php\">https:\u002F\u002Fyeidep.org\u002Fregister.php\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-03-13 10:31:48",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffederal-government-yeidep-portal-registration-for-nigerians-50-000-500-000-grant\u002F69b3d9843b6a13.84363971_screenshot 2026-03-13 101911.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Ffederal-government-yeidep-portal-registration-for-nigerians-50-000-500-000-grant\u002F69b3d9843b6a13.84363971_screenshot%202026-03-13%20101911.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,37,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":9},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fi